Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.41,0:13:26.45,screen1,,0,0,0,,{\frz13.5\pos(1550,1005)\1c&89838F&\fs68\be1}罩
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:26.99,screen1,,0,0,0,,{\frz13.5\pos(1542,980)\1c&89838F&\fs68\be1}罩
